		"en": [
			"From the side story project \"SDGundam World Heroes THE LEGEND OF DRAGON KNIGHT\", a dark dragon that pairs with \"SDW HEROES Shine Glasper Dragon\" appears!",
			"•More than 12 parts of the body can be moved, allowing you to enjoy display in various poses.",
			"• Some of the head parts are newly sculpted.",
